\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Block diagram of the function generator circuit. The signal flows the comparator-based square wave oscillator to an op-amp integrator that outputs a triangle wave, and finally to a nonlinear shaping circuit that produces a sine wave.}}{1}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
