\newlabel{fig:block}{{1}{1}{Block diagram of the function generator circuit. The signal flows the comparator-based square wave oscillator to an op-amp integrator that outputs a triangle wave, and finally to a nonlinear shaping circuit that produces a sine wave}{figure.caption.1}{}}
